  "slug": "oracledb",
  "name": "Oracledb",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect, query, and interact with Oracle Databases and their data.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `oracledb`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install oracledb@claude-plugins-official` from `gemini-cli-extensions/oracledb`.\n\nThis repository packages MCP Toolbox's prebuilt `oracledb` server as a plugin/extension to interact with Oracle Database instances. It can be used with various AI agents, including Antigravity, Claude Code and Codex, to manage your databases, execute queries, explore schemas, and troubleshoot issues using natural language prompts.",
